---
/* Features — staggered fragment cells. Each cell is one capability: a short
   text part and a real piece of the app docked to the opposite edge, cropped
   by the cell. Row one runs text-top, fragment-top, text-top; row two the
   reverse, so the fragments form a checkerboard. */
---
<section class="feat wrap" id="inside" aria-labelledby="feat-title">
  <h2 id="feat-title" class="head" data-reveal>What’s inside</h2>

  <div class="cells">
    <article class="cell text-top" data-reveal style="--i:0">
      <div class="c-text">
        <h3>Any model</h3>
        <p>OpenRouter’s whole catalogue, direct keys to the big providers, the PC on your desk, or a model that never leaves the phone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="c-frag dock-bottom">
        <ul class="models" data-ui aria-label="Model sources in EchoFlow">
          <li><span class="m-name">OpenRouter</span><span class="m-meta">Cloud · every model on one key</span><span class="m-tag on">Key saved</span></li>
          <li><span class="m-name">Gemma 3 1B</span><span class="m-meta">On-device · 562 MB</span><span class="m-tag">Download</span></li>
          <li><span class="m-name">Qwen3 0.6B</span><span class="m-meta">On-device · 498 MB</span><span class="m-tag">Download</span></li>
          <li><span class="m-name">Ollama API</span><span class="m-meta">http://localhost:11434</span><span class="m-tag on">On</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="cell frag-top" data-reveal style="--i:1">
      <div class="c-frag dock-top">
        <div class="plus" data-ui aria-label="The plus menu">
          <p class="p-group">Attach</p>
          <p class="p-row">Image</p>
          <p class="p-row">Files</p>
          <p class="p-group">Capabilities</p>
          <p class="p-row">Web search</p>
          <p class="p-row is-hover">Deep Research</p>
          <p class="p-row">Artifact</p>
          <p class="p-row">Data Agent</p>
          <p class="p-group">Echo Labs</p>
          <p class="p-row">Echo Agents</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-text">
        <h3>Everything under +</h3>
        <p>Web search, Deep Research with cited reports, artifacts you keep, a data agent that answers in tables, and agents with their own tools.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="cell text-top" data-reveal style="--i:2">
      <div class="c-text">
        <h3>Talk to it</h3>
        <p>A real voice call with a persona you pick. It listens while it speaks, so you can tap anywhere to cut in.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="c-frag dock-bottom pic">
        <img src="/brand/v5/voice-call.jpg" alt="EchoFlow voice call with the Jessica persona: “Hey! What’s on your mind?” over a live waveform"
          width="720" height="1480" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position: 50% 30%" />
      </figure>
    </article>

    <article class="cell frag-top" data-reveal style="--i:0">
      <figure class="c-frag dock-top pic">
        <img src="/brand/v3/imagine-print-dog.jpg" alt="An image made in EchoFlow’s Imagine mode: a golden retriever in driving goggles riding in a red convertible at sunset"
          width="596" height="552" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position: 40% 55%" />
      </figure>
      <div class="c-text">
        <h3>Imagine</h3>
        <p>Describe a picture or a clip, then refine it out loud. Ask for video and close the app; it keeps rendering.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="cell text-top" data-reveal style="--i:1">
      <div class="c-text">
        <h3>Web search, free</h3>
        <p>Live answers with their sources and no key. Bring Exa, Parallel or Firecrawl if you want a different engine.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="c-frag dock-bottom pic">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/brand/v5/clip-web-search-poster.jpg"
          width="540" height="1090" aria-label="Screen recording: EchoFlow searching the web and answering with a table" style="object-position: 50% 35%">
          <source src="/brand/v5/clip-web-search.webm" type="video/webm" />
          <source src="/brand/v5/clip-web-search.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </figure>
    </article>

    <article class="cell frag-top" data-reveal style="--i:2">
      <figure class="c-frag dock-top pic">
        <img src="/brand/v3/07-project-detail.jpg" alt="An EchoFlow project called Shoes with its instructions, twelve attached files and two conversations"
          width="945" height="2048" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position: 50% 9%" />
      </figure>
      <div class="c-text">
        <h3>Projects</h3>
        <p>A room that already knows your files and your rules. Every chat inside starts briefed.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .feat { margin-top: var(--section); }
  .feat > h2 { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .cells { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }

  .cell {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    height: clamp(420px, 32vw, 460px);
    background: var(--surface);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
    transition: background-color var(--t-repaint) ease;
  }
  .c-text { padding: 24px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .c-text h3 { font-size: var(--step-lead); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; }
  .c-text p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--muted); max-width: 38ch; }

  .c-frag { flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; overflow: hidden; }
  .dock-bottom { align-items: flex-end; }
  .dock-top { align-items: flex-end; } /* anchored low, cropped by the cell's top edge */

  /* pictures fill their part of the cell, cropped by it */
  .pic { margin: 0; }
  .pic img, .pic video { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 900ms var(--ease-soft); }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .cell:hover .pic img, .cell:hover .pic video { transform: scale(1.04); }
  }

  /* ---- fragments: the app's own conventions apply inside data-ui ---- */
  .models {
    width: 100%; margin: 0 0 -1px; padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 8px;
    background: var(--lift); border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3;
    transition: background-color var(--t-repaint) ease;
  }
  .models li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; column-gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--bg); transition: background-color var(--t-repaint) ease; }
  .m-name { font-weight: 600; }
  .m-meta { grid-column: 1; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .m-tag { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / 3; align-self: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 12%, var(--lift)); }
  .m-tag.on { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); }

  .plus {
    width: 78%; margin-left: 24px; padding: 10px 8px 14px; display: grid;
    background: var(--lift); border-radius: 0 0 22px 22px;
    font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.2;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -18px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
    transition: background-color var(--t-repaint) ease;
  }
  .p-group { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 12px 4px; }
  .p-row { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .p-row.is-hover { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 14%, var(--lift)); }

  @media (max-width: 60em) {
    .cells { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
    .cell { height: auto; }
    .cell.frag-top { flex-direction: column-reverse; }
    .c-frag { flex: none; }
    .pic { height: 360px; }
    .cell:nth-child(even) .c-frag { justify-content: flex-end; }
    .cell:nth-child(even) .plus { margin-left: 0; margin-right: 24px; border-radius: 22px 22px 0 0; }
    .cell.frag-top .c-frag { align-items: flex-end; }
  }
</style>
